<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Warrior Tank in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 4. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Protection Warrior Tank Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>Keep in mind that gearing your <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/warrior">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> highly depends on your raiding environment. While I may recommend mostly defensive gear sets that will fit the majority of players, only you can know what kind of threat is needed in your raid. If your guild requires a <i>higher threat ceiling</i> to withstand the pressure from high-performing damage dealers, then feel free to mix in threat-oriented items to find the <b>balance</b> between threat and survival that works best for <i>your</i> group. But first, make sure your rotation is on point with this <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-rotation-cooldowns-abilities-pve">Rotation and Cooldowns guide</a>!<br/>
<br/>It is also important to note that gearing as a <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/warrior">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> early on requires constant adjustments to maintain your crit immunity as you upgrade your gear and may lose defense or resilience rating in some slots. Make sure you keep some item alternatives to fill in the gaps in your defense rating when needed.<br/>
<br/>
